  "description": "The capacitated facility location track of FrontierCO (Feng et al., 2025), 70 multi-source instances: 20 easy test instances of 1,000 facilities and 1,000 customers (Avella and Boccia's 1,000 by 1,000 group with each per-unit cost multiplied by the customer's demand), 30 hard test instances of 2,000 by 2,000 and 20 validation instances of 100 by 100, with FrontierCO's reference value for each.",
  "domain": "Facility location",
  "expectedCounts": {},
