  "recipe": {
    "reason": "Its instances hold 140,200,000 facility-customer edges in all, and a graph/v1 result is held whole: the largest such set read and round-tripped whole has 13,125,000 edges (ufllib-koerkel-ghosh-symmetric), and reading the 22,750,000 of ufllib-k-median whole ran out of the default Node heap. It becomes fetchable when graph/v1 results can be streamed (https://github.com/Mearman/keepset/issues/305).",
    "status": "not-fetchable"
  },
